                        %mi i
                        %mo ≤
                        %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (a, b, \omega, \lambda \in (\mathbb{R}^n)^*)_{1 \leq i \leq n}
              a collection of ordinary covectors and with “
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo ⋅
