                        %mn 2
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}^2
            %p Of course for this identification to be more than a coincidence we need that this is the beginning of a pattern that holds more generally. But this is indeed the case.
          %h4#properties Properties
          %p
