              of vector spaces.
          %p
            So inside the space of functions on infinitesimal simplices, we find the
            = succeed "s." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+form"} differential form
            %em natural reason
            , from the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nPOV"} nPOV
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi C
